<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_986_2995.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, sampt was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebß</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotß</unclear> vermoegent zuovor, from fürsichtig
<lb n="3"/>ersam und wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear> guot fründt und getrüw
<lb n="4"/>lieb Eydtgnossen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitrath</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Walther</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Roll</unclear></persName>, ritter, hat unß, von siner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear> wegen, ouch
<lb n="6"/>innamen unnsers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtamans</unclear>, herren <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jost</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schmids</unclear></persName>
<lb n="7"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">houptman</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear> im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hoffß</unclear></persName>, sampt andern iren
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwegern</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vettern</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgetragen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerkennen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>geben, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begegnet</unclear>, daß ir lieber schwager
<lb n="10"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Krom</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> burger, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spital</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hüser</unclear>, gegen
<lb n="11"/>üch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villicht</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungnaden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kon</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlicher</unclear> sachen, die
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgemelten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Krom</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbewüstent</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gezigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sye</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuorden</unclear>. Deßhalben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genampter</unclear> ir schwager sich etlich
<lb n="14"/>tag, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfencknuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entzogen</unclear>. Und so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> er, sich
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverantwuorten</unclear>, wie billich willens gewesen, und
<lb n="16"/>der sachen halben, von üch, durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sine</unclear> verwandten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleit</unclear>
