<lb n="37"/>sind wir. und die unsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ungezwyffelter</unclear> hoffnung. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Er</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepür</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear>. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> ehren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gmaeß</unclear>. wüssen
